; delay_n, delays n cycles with small code
; Will clobber A, S, and Z+N
; Will preserve X, Y, C, D, V, and I (interrupt-disable flag)
;
; WARNING: THIS VERSION CLOBBERS THE STACK POINTER.
;
; Requires a dummy interrupt handler that does nothing but RTI.
;
; Requires that a label @nearby_rts is defined,
; that points _somewhere_ that contains a $60 byte (RTS).
;
; Requires that a label @nearby_rts_14cyc is defined,
; that points _somewhere_ that contains a dummy 2-cycle
; opcode, such as NOP or LDA #1, followed by a $60 byte (RTS).
;
; Requires that a label @nearby_rts_15cyc is defined,
; that points _somewhere_ that contains a JMP to a location that does RTS.

; Requires a disposable zeropage variable @zptemp.
;
; Requires a function called "delay_a_27_clocks"
; that is defined as follows:
;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;
;; Delays A clocks + overhead
;; Clobbers A. Preserves X,Y.
;; Time: A+27 clocks (including JSR)
;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;
;delay_a_27_clocks:
;        ;          ;    Cycles        Accumulator     Carry flag
;        ;          ; 0  1  2  3  4       (hex)        0 1 2 3 4
;        sec        ; 0  0  0  0  0   00 01 02 03 04   1 1 1 1 1
;:       sbc #5     ; 2  2  2  2  2   FB FC FD FE FF   0 0 0 0 0
;        bcs :-     ; 4  4  4  4  4   FB FC FD FE FF   0 0 0 0 0
;        lsr a      ; 6  6  6  6  6   7D 7E 7E 7F 7F   1 0 1 0 1
;        bcc :+     ; 8  8  8  8  8   7D 7E 7E 7F 7F   1 0 1 0 1
;:       sbc #$7E   ;10 11 10 11 10   FF FF 00 00 01   0 0 1 1 1
;        bcc :+     ;12 13 12 13 12   FF FF 00 00 01   0 0 1 1 1
;        beq :+     ;      14 15 14         00 00 01       1 1 1
;        bne :+     ;            16               01           1
;:       rts        ;15 16 17 18 19
;
; Generated code is:
; -22 bytes or less when n <= 891
; -43 bytes or less when n <= 1530
; -65 bytes or less when n <= 2291
; -86 bytes or less when n <= 2891
; -108 bytes or less when n <= 3495
; -129 bytes or less when n <= 4095
; -151 bytes or less when n <= 4704
; -172 bytes or less when n <= 5304
; -194 bytes or less when n <= 5908
; -215 bytes or less when n <= 6508
; -237 bytes or less when n <= 7117
; -258 bytes or less when n <= 7717
; -280 bytes or less when n <= 8321
; -301 bytes or less when n <= 8921
; -323 bytes or less when n <= 9530
; -344 bytes or less when n <= 10130
; -366 bytes or less when n <= 10891
; -387 bytes or less when n <= 11491
; -409 bytes or less when n <= 12095
; -430 bytes or less when n <= 12695
; -452 bytes or less when n <= 13304
; -473 bytes or less when n <= 13904
; -495 bytes or less when n <= 14508
; -516 bytes or less when n <= 15108
; -538 bytes or less when n <= 15717
; -559 bytes or less when n <= 16317
; -581 bytes or less when n <= 16921
; -602 bytes or less when n <= 17521
; -624 bytes or less when n <= 18130
; -645 bytes or less when n <= 18730
; -667 bytes or less when n <= 19491
; -688 bytes or less when n <= 20000
; Detailed summary:
; - When 2 <= n <= 10: min=1, avg=1.9, max=3
; - When 11 <= n <= 20: min=2, avg=3.2, max=4
; - When 21 <= n <= 30: min=4, avg=4.8, max=5
; - When 31 <= n <= 50: min=6, avg=6.8, max=7
; - When 51 <= n <= 75: min=7, avg=7.0, max=7
; - When 76 <= n <= 100: min=7, avg=7.0, max=7
; - When 101 <= n <= 200: min=7, avg=7.0, max=7
; - When 201 <= n <= 300: min=7, avg=7.1, max=9
; - When 301 <= n <= 500: min=9, avg=11.9, max=14
; - When 501 <= n <= 750: min=14, avg=17.8, max=22
; - When 751 <= n <= 1000: min=22, avg=23.9, max=27
; - When 1001 <= n <= 2000: min=27, avg=41.1, max=58
; - When 2001 <= n <= 3000: min=58, avg=75.2, max=93
; - When 3001 <= n <= 5000: min=93, avg=127.7, max=163
